{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899790/extras/208273a6f755ec92e49896e5a32f2706.poster.avif?t=1754495162\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899790/extras/208273a6f755ec92e49896e5a32f2706.webm?t=1754495162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899790/extras/208273a6f755ec92e49896e5a32f2706.mp4?t=1754495162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WELCOME, UNIT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Filthium Zero is a single-player action roguelite featuring a mix of vertical and ground combat. Purge the Filthium-infested zones of Earth, battle hordes of mutants, unlock powerful upgrades to survive, and watch the ragdolls fly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PURGE, SURVIVE, ADVANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission: purge the corrupted zones of Earth by extracting Filthium from the water and depositing it into  Collectors, while defeating hordes of zombies and mutants. Each deployment is a new UNIT soldier, armed with upgrades secured by their predecessors. Gather resources, improve survival odds, and push UNIT\u2019s mission forward - one soldier at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VERTICAL &amp; GROUND COMBAT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce off slimes to launch into the air, throw your Extraction Barrel from the sky for a heavy impact, slam yourself down with force, and send ragdolls flying in every direction. Activate and combine powerful abilities, collect resources, and customize the next UNIT with a growing arsenal of upgrades.  <br><br>DEPLOY NOW, UNIT!\u00a0\ud83d\udc80</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What's included in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extract and deposit Filthium to progress;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vertical and ground combat: Bounce off slimes, chain mid-air attacks, slam down for devastating finishers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 minute time limit per run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 playable level with randomized rotation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 playable class</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 main weapons, selected pre-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 main abilities (including main weapon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 unique perks, selected pre-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 ultimate ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 unique boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 unique enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">57 randomized in-game upgrades, including mods, auto-abilities and upgrades to main abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shop with 10 meta upgrades, each with multiple ranks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lootboxes for additional mid-run upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy ragdolls on death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single player only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">English language only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller recommended (keyboard+mouse supported)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899790?t=1754495162","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899790/36cd9493ca8847327e9350a56c51fce3bc82bcf8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754495162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899790/4cad52047cf265c293a90e1be6e6ce3ac2d9d978/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754495162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899790/4cad52047cf265c293a90e1be6e6ce3ac2d9d978/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754495162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":1